      "message": "Tests no (or not at this point at least), but CS is using this in its startup sequence (specifically when it creates the AutomaticOnOffKeepaliveTracker). So there needs to be a mock of this with some functionality.\n\nBeyond that, I thought it was better to instrument it in the same way it was already instrumented in ConnectivityServiceTest. This will save time later if we move some of the tests that need this instrumentation ; after all, that\u0027s what we have converged to.\n\nFor initMockResources it\u0027s even clearer, since it\u0027s the list of resources that CS actually reads when it starts, so they need to be mocked.",
