      "message": "I put it here because it\u0027s only used here (in l.103), but it doesn\u0027t really matter too much. Maybe it\u0027s better in CSTest. Moved.\n\nOriginally I wrote everything in CSTest, and found that it made the file very long and unwieldly. So the principle I used to split this was : are the implementation details of a given mock usually going to be important to someone writing a test ? If not, let\u0027s move them away in CSTestHelper, which can hold the details that you only look at when you want to add instrumentation.\n\nDoes that make sense ?",
